# A C4 title written with the escapes mermaid decodes

The title holds a "#", a ";" and a quotation mark. The first two are the C4
title lexer's own punctuation and arrive as "#35;" and "#59;"; mermaid decodes
both before it draws them, so the checker has to as well or it reports this
title as missing.

```mermaid
C4Context
    title Ledger #35;1: "core"#59; v2
    Person(customer, "Customer")
    System(ledger, "Ledger")
    Rel(customer, ledger, "Reads #quot;the balance#quot;")
```
